// GIFTS GIVEN
"Val.Gift.1": "Hey @! I found this down below, can you get it to Gunther for me? Thanks! [100 101 103 104 105 106 108 109 110 111 112 113 115 116 117 118 119 120 121 122 123]$1",
"Val.Gift.2": "Hey, @! I met with the desert trader - I had some unusual minerals they were looking for, so we did a little exchange. This is an excellent study piece! [124 125]$1",
"Val.Gift.3": "Hey, @! I dug up a fossil, check it out. Feel free to pass it along to Gunther for me, I'm not sure if we've found this particular one yet. [586 587 588 589]$1",
"Val.Gift.4": "Hey, @! I've got a bone to pick with- nah, just kidding. Just found something down below you might need for the museum. [96 97 98 99]$17",
"Val.Gift.5": "Hey, @! I found something weird on Ginger Island, think it might be of use to you? [579 580 581 582 583 584 585]$0",
"Val.Gift.6": "Hey, @! I had some extra ore and hammered out some ingots. Figured I'd share.$1 #$action AddItem {{Random: (O)Copper_Bar, (O)Iron_Bar, (O)Gold_Bar, (O)Iridium_Bar}} {{Random: {{Range: 1,3}}}}",
"Val.Gift.7": "Hey, @! I collected an over-abundance of coal. Not trying to imply you're not a good noodle or anything, I just figured I'd share the wealth. #$action AddItem (O)Coal {{Random: {{Range: 20,50}}}}",
"Val.Gift.8": "Hey, @! Guess what? I got you a treat.$17 #$action AddItem (O)DN.SnS_ChocolateOrange",
